//play: start wt pad 1 (change shimmer) then add pad 2. I add first instances with p, at some point i add them with w to create rythm and keep adding with p from time to time.
//  Then I add buz, buz2 and buz3. I add them overaid with w on 1 instance when pads are at max and then let pads die.
//  Then paly wit pitches and keep adding instances of all, but specially buz2 till saturation of sound.

//PADS
pad > source zen loop 15 
  pitch 0 5 8 3 12 rotate 1 
  delay 1 gain .8 
  reverb 1
  shimmer .2 //max .8
  delay 1 dt 1000 dfb 0.8

pad2 > source zen loop 15 
  pitch 0 12 48 24 
  delay 1 dt 50 1000 100 
  reverb 1

//BUZZ
buz > source buzz loop 5
  pitch -12 len 2 delay 1 shimmer .1 .2 .4 .6

buz2 > source buzz loop 2.5
  pitch 0 len 1 delay 1 dt 100 200

buz3 > source buzz loop 2.5
  pitch 31 48 12 12 31 48 rotate 1
  len .2 delay 1 dt 100


